"""Judge whether installing the company host through apt leaves a working machine.

The rig boots one disposable arm64 Debian guest with nothing of ours on it,
serves an apt repository from this Mac, runs the install, and then reads the
guest's own state: dpkg's database, systemd's, the filesystem. Nothing here
judges a transcript of what the install printed.

    tools/test-native-install --help
"""

